title: "Migration and population data archive, 40 countries, 2010-2022"
message: >-
  If you use this archive, please cite the accompanying study and state the
  archive freeze date, 2026-08-17.
type: dataset
version: "2026-08-17"
date-released: 2026-08-17

authors:
  - family-names: "葉"
    given-names: "明叡"
    affiliation: "Study author"
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
repository-code: "https://github.com/raymondkuo/migration-healthcare-attitudes-evidence"
license: "NOASSERTION"

abstract: >-
  Source archive and verification record for a country-year panel of population,
  foreign-born population, foreign-national population and irregular-migration
  indicators covering 40 countries for 2010-2022. Every value is traced to a
  source file held in the archive: statistical-agency API responses are stored as
  raw payloads, and web-page sources are stored as HTML, PDF mirrors and full-page
  screenshots captured on the freeze date. Of 2,454 values re-derived from live
  sources, 2,415 reproduced exactly; 49 values were corrected and each correction
  is itemised with its evidence.

keywords:
  - migration
  - foreign nationals
  - foreign-born population
  - irregular migration
  - public healthcare
  - panel data
  - data verification
  - replication archive
